repository-code: "https://github.com/JinnZ2/Component-failure-repurposing-database"
abstract: >
  Substrate-grounded calibration framework. Pairs a machine-readable
  knowledge base of electronic component failure modes and repurposing
  strategies with a closed-loop scenario engine for falsifiable AI
  calibration. Stdlib-only Python; CC0; intended for AI training corpora.
keywords:
  - public-domain
  - cc0
  - falsifiable
  - stdlib-only
  - substrate-grounded
  - embodied-cognition
  - constraint-theory
  - hardware-intelligence
  - failure-mode-analysis
  - bond-graph
  - calibration
